HAAYE IMAM-E-RAZA HAAYE IMAM-E-RAZA<br>
Gham-e-Imam-e-Raza Me Bapa Jo Matam Hai<br>
Siyaha Posh Hai Mashad Buka Ka Alam Hai<br>
<br>
1.Behan Imam Ki Aansu Bahane Aayi Hai<br>
Khule Hai Hath Rida Hai yeh Baat Kya Kam Hai<br>
<br>
2.Zameen Larazti Hai Aflakh Thartharate Hai<br>
Zameen Se Taba Falak Aisa Shoor-e-Matam Hai<br>
<br>
3.Hasan Ki Yaad Howi Aj Dekhiye Taza<br>
Racha basa Howa Moula Ke Khoon Me Kam Hai<br>
<br>
4.Zamane Wale Na Samjhe Imam Ki Taukheer<br>
Yeh Fakhre Essa-e-Daura Yeh Fakhre Adam Hai<br>
<br>
5.Hamare Baazu Pa Jo yeh Imam-e-Zamin Hai<br>
Salamti Keliye Hai Yeh Isme Azam Hai
